{"seq":2,"slug":"ugc-moderation","title":"UGC 审核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice/ugc-moderation","wordCount":1552,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ugc-审核\">UGC 审核</h1><p><a href=\"mod-security\">Mod 安全</a> 防的是「代码会害人」，UGC 审核防的是「内容不该存在」。一个开放上传的平台每天涌入上万件作品，其中难免夹着侵权素材、仇恨内容、色情图片、引流广告。纯人工审核审不过来，纯机器审核又会误杀和漏放。本篇讲如何把哈希黑名单、自动分类、人工复审、社区举报拼成一条能扛住海量内容的治理流水线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>UGC 审核的根本约束是「规模与准确的矛盾」：内容量大到人工看不完，而机器判断又不够准。出路不是二选一，而是分层漏斗——用廉价高速的自动手段过滤掉绝大多数明确无害和明确有害的内容，只把模棱两可的少数送到昂贵的人工复审。审核的时机也有选择：发布前审（pre-moderation，慢但干净）还是发布后审（post-moderation，快但有暴露窗口）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[作者上传内容] --&gt; B[L1 哈希黑名单&lt;br/&gt;已知违规秒拦]&#10;    B --&gt;|命中| Z[拒绝]&#10;    B --&gt;|未命中| C[L2 自动分类&lt;br/&gt;图像/文本模型打分]&#10;    C --&gt;|高危| Z&#10;    C --&gt;|明确无害| D[发布]&#10;    C --&gt;|模糊| E[L3 人工复审队列]&#10;    E --&gt;|违规| Z&#10;    E --&gt;|合规| D&#10;    D --&gt; F[L4 社区举报]&#10;    F --&gt;|被举报| E&#10;    F --&gt; G[信誉系统更新]&#10;    G --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n    A[作者上传内容] --&gt; B[L1 哈希黑名单&lt;br/&gt;已知违规秒拦]\n    B --&gt;|命中| Z[拒绝]\n    B --&gt;|未命中| C[L2 自动分类&lt;br/&gt;图像/文本模型打分]\n    C --&gt;|高危| Z\n    C --&gt;|明确无害| D[发布]\n    C --&gt;|模糊| E[L3 人工复审队列]\n    E --&gt;|违规| Z\n    E --&gt;|合规| D\n    D --&gt; F[L4 社区举报]\n    F --&gt;|被举报| E\n    F --&gt; G[信誉系统更新]\n    G --&gt; C</pre><p>审核策略在「时机」和「主体」两个维度上有不同组合，下表对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>主体</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发布前人工审</td>\n<td>上线前</td>\n<td>人</td>\n<td>干净、零暴露</td>\n<td>慢、贵、不可扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布前自动审</td>\n<td>上线前</td>\n<td>机器</td>\n<td>快、可扩展</td>\n<td>误杀/漏放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布后审 + 举报</td>\n<td>上线后</td>\n<td>机器+社区</td>\n<td>极快上线</td>\n<td>有暴露窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合漏斗</td>\n<td>分层</td>\n<td>机器筛+人工兜底</td>\n<td>平衡规模与准确</td>\n<td>实现复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层漏斗-让机器干粗活-人干细活\">分层漏斗：让机器干粗活、人干细活</h2><p>审核流水线的骨架是一个逐层收窄的漏斗，每一层都比上一层更贵、处理量更少。第一层是哈希黑名单——对已知违规内容（如被多次举报删除的图片）算感知哈希，新上传秒级比对命中即拦。这一层成本极低却能挡掉大量重复上传的违规内容。</p>\n<p>第二层是自动分类：图像识别模型判别色情/暴力/仇恨符号，文本模型判别辱骂/广告/敏感词。模型给每件内容打一个风险分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，用双阈值分流：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s &gt; \\theta_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接拒、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s &lt; \\theta_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接放、中间地带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{low} \\le s \\le \\theta_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才进人工队列。两个阈值的取舍直接决定了人工工作量与漏放率的平衡——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 调高会减少误杀但增加人工量。第三层才是人工复审，只处理机器拿不准的少数。这种「廉价信号筛选 + 昂贵判断兜底」的结构，与 <a href=\"../ecosystem/mod-distribution\">分发与 Workshop</a> 的发现排序、反作弊的统计检测同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准确率的代价-误杀与漏放的权衡\">准确率的代价：误杀与漏放的权衡</h2><p>任何自动审核都逃不过两类错误：把无害内容判为违规（误杀，false positive）和把违规内容放过去（漏放，false negative）。这两者不可能同时压到零——收紧标准减少漏放就会增加误杀，反之亦然。用混淆矩阵的语言，审核系统的运营目标是在给定漏放容忍度下最大化精确率。</p>\n<p>设违规内容的真实占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>、模型召回率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、精确率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，则漏放量正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi(1-R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，误杀量正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\pi R (1-P)}{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。平台必须根据内容的危害等级选择工作点：儿童安全相关内容要把召回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 推到极高（宁可误杀），而广告这类低危内容可以容忍更高漏放、避免骚扰正常作者。这个权衡没有技术上的最优解，是一个由内容危害与社区容忍度共同决定的运营决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"社区举报-把治理众包给玩家\">社区举报：把治理众包给玩家</h2><p>机器和人工都覆盖不全，第四层防线是社区举报——让玩家标记他们看到的问题内容。举报是高价值信号，但也会被滥用（恶意举报刷掉竞争对手的 mod）。因此举报不能直接触发删除，而要接入信誉系统：高信誉用户的举报权重高，被反复证实误报的用户权重降低。</p>\n<p>形式化地，对内容 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的举报置信度可建模为加权和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(m) = \\sum_i w_i \\cdot r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个用户的举报、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其信誉权重；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 超过阈值才升级到人工复审或自动降权。举报信号还会回流到发现排序——一个被大量举报的 mod，其曝光会被 <a href=\"../ecosystem/mod-distribution\">分发与 Workshop</a> 的排序公式压低，形成「治理—曝光」的负反馈闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版权与合规-绕不开的法律红线\">版权与合规：绕不开的法律红线</h2><p>UGC 审核不只是品味问题，更是法律问题。玩家上传的 mod 可能包含受版权保护的素材（其他游戏的模型、音乐、角色），平台对此负有法律责任。美国 DMCA 的「通知—移除」机制、欧盟《数字服务法》（DSA）的内容治理义务，都要求平台建立可响应的下架流程。</p>\n<p>合规还触及更敏感的领域：未成年人保护、地区法律差异（同一内容在不同国家合法性不同）、付费 UGC 的税务与消费者权益。这些与 <a href=\"ugc-monetization\">UGC 商业化</a> 的法律边界、以及跨库 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/analytics-ethics/ethics-regulation\">伦理与监管</a> 中游戏行业的监管框架直接相连。一个务实的判断是：审核系统的设计必须从一开始就把「可审计、可响应下架、可按地区差异化」作为硬需求，而非事后补丁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>UGC 审核防「内容不该存在」（侵权/仇恨/色情/广告），区别于 <a href=\"mod-security\">Mod 安全</a> 防「代码会害人」。</li>\n<li>根本约束是规模与准确的矛盾，出路是分层漏斗：廉价手段筛掉绝大多数，只把模糊内容送昂贵人工。</li>\n<li>四层防线：哈希黑名单（秒拦已知违规）→自动分类（双阈值分流）→人工复审（处理模糊）→社区举报（众包兜底）。</li>\n<li>自动审核逃不过误杀与漏放的权衡，按内容危害等级选工作点：儿童安全推高召回宁可误杀，低危内容容忍漏放。</li>\n<li>社区举报须接信誉系统按权重聚合（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(m)=\\sum w_i r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）防滥用，并回流压低问题内容曝光。</li>\n<li>审核是法律问题：DMCA/DSA 要求可响应下架，系统须从设计起就支持可审计、可下架、可按地区差异化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>防代码而非防内容的那一面：<a href=\"mod-security\">Mod 安全与沙箱逃逸</a></li>\n<li>举报信号回流的发现排序：<a href=\"../ecosystem/mod-distribution\">分发与 Workshop</a></li>\n<li>付费 UGC 的法律边界：<a href=\"ugc-monetization\">UGC 商业化</a></li>\n<li>跨库：游戏行业的伦理与监管：<a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/analytics-ethics/ethics-regulation\">伦理与监管</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"UGC 审核","id":"ugc-审核"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分层漏斗：让机器干粗活、人干细活","id":"分层漏斗-让机器干粗活-人干细活"},{"level":2,"text":"准确率的代价：误杀与漏放的权衡","id":"准确率的代价-误杀与漏放的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"社区举报：把治理众包给玩家","id":"社区举报-把治理众包给玩家"},{"level":2,"text":"版权与合规：绕不开的法律红线","id":"版权与合规-绕不开的法律红线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Mod 安全与沙箱逃逸","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice/mod-security"},"next":{"title":"UGC 商业化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice/ugc-monetization"}}